      children: [(0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.strong, {
        children: "Osho Darshan:"
      }), " This is Arjuna at his most traditional — the voice of the establishment frightened for its structures. Osho would not lecture the verse but peel it: beneath the old sociology is a genuine insight about the fabric of society, that when honour is broken in one place it cracks everywhere. But the Gita's deeper teaching will replace this fear with a truth: no caste, no family law, no arrangement of the world can protect the human being — only inner transformation can. Arjuna is still looking for outer protection; Krishna will show him the inner fortress."]
